# Device-specific camera properties template
# Rename parent folder from _template to your lowercase device codename
# (check with: adb shell getprop ro.product.vendor.device)
#
# Examples (uncomment & adjust only what your specific modded APK & ROM need):
#
# Expose auxiliary / ultrawide / telephoto / macro cameras to MiuiCamera:
# persist.vendor.camera.expose.aux=1
#
# Leica / Watermark / Device branding props (only if required by your modded APK):
# ro.product.mod_device=<codename>_global
# ro.product.vendor.marketname=Xiaomi 14
# ro.miui.customized.region=global
#
# MediaTek / Snapdragon HAL tuning examples:
# persist.vendor.camera.privapp.list=com.android.camera
# vendor.camera.aux.packagelist=com.android.camera
